<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5227] Zeppelin 0.9.0 cannot create paragraph after call create note http api </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5227</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hi&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;With zeppelin 0.9.0, when I call create note http api, like this:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;POST [http://[zeppelin-server]:[zeppelin-port]/api/notebook]&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;JSON:&#160;{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;test&quot;}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The response is OK, but no paragraph is been&#160; initialized, and I can not create any paragraph either.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
