                            <comment id="17276008" author="zjffdu" created="Mon, 1 Feb 2021 00:00:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zBowen&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zBowen&quot;&gt;zBowen&lt;/a&gt;&#160;This api is used for zeppelin client api, so no paragraph is created. You can call another rest api to add paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;BTW why you would create note via rest api and then add paragraph via ui manually ?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17276100" author="zbowen" created="Mon, 1 Feb 2021 07:08:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zjffdu&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zjffdu&quot;&gt;zjffdu&lt;/a&gt;&#160;Thank you for your reply.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;BTW why you would create note via rest api and then add paragraph via ui manually ?&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Because we want to develop a platform based on zeppelin, but on current stage, we don not have enough front-end resources, so we embeded zeppelin UI in our platform directly, and when we upgade zeppelin to version 0.9.0, we find this problem.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The API should be stable, and I hope the version 0.9.0 will be consistent with the 0.9.0-preview-2, I will fix this if it is necessay in the near future.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
